# Everything here is text, and all of it is line-ending sensitive.
#
# A bundle is stored one record per line so a diff reads as the metres that
# changed, and index.json records each bundle's size in bytes. Both of those
# break in a working tree checked out with CRLF endings: the size grows by one
# byte per line, so `python tools/build_index.py` on Windows writes an index
# that CI — which counts LF — reports as stale, for files nobody touched.
#
# Normalise on the way in, hand out LF on the way out, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
